sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant S3Gateway as API Gateway (S3Gateway)
    participant FileController
    participant FileService
    participant S3Repository
    participant AWSS3 as AWS S3

    %% Step 1: Client initiates deletion request
    Client->>S3Gateway: DELETE /s3/delete/{bucket}/{fileKey}
    S3Gateway->>FileController: Forward delete request

    %% Step 2: Controller processes request
    FileController->>FileService: Validate request and call deleteFile(bucket, fileKey)

    %% Step 3: Service performs deletion
    FileService->>S3Repository: deleteFile(bucket, fileKey)
    S3Repository->>AWSS3: Delete object from bucket
    AWSS3-->>S3Repository: Deletion successful
    S3Repository-->>FileService: Return success result

    %% Step 4: Return response
    FileService-->>FileController: Confirm deletion
    FileController-->>S3Gateway: Send 200 OK response
    S3Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK — File deleted successfully